+Bitcoin
+Address Types:
+Legacy
+- Starts with
+1
+Example:
+1A1zP1eP5QGefi2DMPTfTL5SLmv7DivfNa
+P2SH
+- Starts with
+3
+Example:
+3J98t1WpEZ73CNmYviecrnyiWrnqRhWNLy
+Bech32
+- Starts with
+bc1
+Example:
+bc1qw508d6qejxtdg4y5r3zarvary0c5xw7kygt080
+Taproot
+- Starts with
+bc1p
+Example:
+bc1p5cyxnuxmeuwuvkwfem96llyr29s8l68p7z6zgt7zdkv3g7zv3qvqz6z8h7
+Signing Standard:
+BIP-322 (Bitcoin Knots, Bitcoin Core, Sparrow)
+✅ All address types supported
