+Signing standards reference
+NEAR Intents supports multiple signing standards to work with different wallet types and blockchain ecosystems.
+Standard
+Compatible Wallets
+Status
+NEP-413
+NEAR wallets: MyNearWallet, Meteor, Sender, Ledger-NEAR
+✅ Implemented
+ERC-191
+All EVM wallets: MetaMask, Rabby, Rainbow, WalletConnect-compatible
+✅ Implemented
+Raw Ed25519
+Solana wallets: Phantom, Solflare, Slope
+✅ Implemented
+Passkeys (WebAuthn)
+Browsers/OS: Chrome, Safari, Edge, Firefox, native apps
+✅ Implemented
+SEP-53
+Stellar wallets: Freighter, Lumens Wallet, SatoshiPay
+✅ Implemented
+TIP-191
+TRON wallets: TronLink, Klever, Trust Wallet
+✅ Implemented
+TON Connect
+TON wallets: Tonkeeper, EverWallet, HOT Wallet
+✅ Implemented
+BIP-322
+Bitcoin wallets: Sparrow, Bitcoin Knots, Bitcoin Core
+⚙️ In progress
+For technical details on how intent signing works, see
+Signing Intents
+.
